abstract: >-
  Research harness that evaluates least-privilege violations and privilege
  escalation of LLM agents under injected tool failures, with and without
  access-control mediators (none, SEAgent-style MAC, intent-based IBAC).
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - least privilege
  - privilege escalation
  - access control
  - tool use
